    {
        "content": "<p>There is a bug in Vector.scanr. I can prove 2+2=5 with native_decide:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2598x810\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/_Wxl1jQsbV0WaNpgHQgoo0ub/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/_Wxl1jQsbV0WaNpgHQgoo0ub/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
