        "content": "<p>I believe this is the fix<br>\n<img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1432x180\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/OwTshcS0_0E_GhlGsxPH1XD5/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/OwTshcS0_0E_GhlGsxPH1XD5/image.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\n(in <code>scanrMFast</code>)</p>",
